  "$comment": [
    "Towns and villages of the v2 location tree (reference/v2/src/locations.js), imported as",
    "approved localities so that nothing a v2 user could pick is lost (docs/V2_PARITY.md).",
    "name_ar is the v2 spelling; name_latin is the usual Latin spelling of the place.",
    "match: the administrative area the v2 region corresponds to, best candidate first (level +",
    "English or Swahili name as imported). The first one that exists is used; when none exists",
    "the locality is attached to the country only.",
    "lon/lat: approximate town centre (WGS 84, +-2 km), null when not known reliably. When the",
    "point lies inside an imported boundary the database attaches the locality to the deepest",
    "area containing it instead of the matched region.",
    "id = ref_uuid('locality:v2:<ISO2>:<region key>:<locality key>'): never change the keys."
